#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:22
msgid "WW3 Triangular Mesh (Projected)"
msgstr "WW3三角メッシュ（投影）"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:24
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to render a projected unstructured triangular "
"mesh."
msgstr "この例は，投影された非構造三角メッシュのレンダリング方法を示します．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:27
msgid "📋 Summary"
msgstr "📋 まとめ"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:29
msgid ""
"Creates a mesh from 1D latitude and longitude unstructured points and "
"connectivity. o The resulting mesh contains triangular cells. The "
"connectivity is required to construct the cells by indexing into the "
"unstructured points."
msgstr ""
"1次元の緯度と経度の非構造点と接続性からメッシュを作成します．結果のメッシュは三角形セルを含みます．セルを構築するには，非構造点をインデックスとして接続性が必要です．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:34
msgid ""
"WAVEWATCH III (WW3) sea surface wave significant height data is located on "
"mesh nodes/points, which are then interpolated across the mesh faces/cells."
msgstr "WAVEWATCH III (WW3) の海面波の有義波高データは、メッシュの節点/点に配置され、メッシュ面/セルに渡って補間されます。"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:37
msgid ""
"A Natural Earth base layer is rendered along with Natural Earth coastlines, "
"and the mesh is also transformed to the Hammer & Eckert-Greifendorff "
"azimuthal projection."
msgstr ""
"Natural EarthベースレイヤーとNatural Earth海岸線がレンダリングされ，メッシュはHammer & Eckert-"
"Greifendorff方位投影に変換されます．"

#: ../../geovista/docs/src/generated/gallery/unstructured/tri_hammer.rst:48
msgid ""
"🏷 Tags: component: coastlines component: texture domain: oceanography load: "
"unstructured projection: crs version: 0.1.0"
msgstr ""
"🏷 Tags: component: coastlines component: texture domain: oceanography load: "
"unstructured projection: crs version: 0.1.0"

